        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Magnet Game</i>, a retro-inspired 2D puzzle adventure where opposites don’t just attract – they’re the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide two marvellous magnets through twisting mazes packed with obstacles, doors, and devious switches. The deeper you go, the more mind-bending the puzzles become – as left becomes right and every second counts. Connect the magnets as fast as you can to beat the clock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnetic Mechanics</strong> – Use red and blue charges to activate switches and unlock doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong> – Outsmart pressure plates, buttons, and timer switches across tricky levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Thinking</strong> – Test both your timing and your logic under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Aesthetic</strong> – Industrial sci-fi visuals with crisp pixel art and arcade charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bring the magnets together before time runs out?</p>",
